================================================================================

This software replicates and extends the empirical work of Shaikh, Anwar and
E. Ahmet Tonak (1994), "Measuring the Wealth of Nations: The Political Economy
of National Accounts" (Cambridge University Press), which is itself a
copyrighted work. Source data is derived from US federal agencies (BEA, BLS,
Federal Reserve / FRED), which is in the public domain.

External-study source data (Mohun 2005, Mohun 2013, Moos 2017, Cronin 2001,
Karabacak & Tonak 2022) is included as cached CSV under fair-use research
provisions; see each study's DPR for paper citations and source attribution.
